stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> draft : AI analysis saved<br/>(chat/analyze)

    draft --> submitted : Policyholder starts claim<br/>[verdict = covered ∧ clause exists in DB]
    draft --> adjuster_booked : Policyholder books adjuster
    submitted --> adjuster_booked : Policyholder books adjuster<br/>(slot claimed atomically)

    submitted --> inspected : Adjuster records inspection
    adjuster_booked --> inspected : Adjuster records inspection

    inspected --> settlement_proposed : Adjuster proposes amount<br/>[amount ≤ sum insured ∧ documents complete]
    settlement_proposed --> settlement_proposed : Adjuster revises proposal
    settlement_proposed --> approved : Admin approves<br/>payout_due = today + 5 days
    approved --> settled : Admin marks paid out

    submitted --> rejected : Admin rejects (reason required)
    adjuster_booked --> rejected : Admin rejects
    inspected --> rejected : Admin rejects
    settlement_proposed --> rejected : Admin rejects
    approved --> rejected : Admin rejects

    settled --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]

    note right of draft
        Not shown to the policyholder as a claim
    end note
    note right of submitted
        UI label: AI Verified
    end note
    note right of adjuster_booked
        UI label: Pending Adjuster
    end note
    note right of settlement_proposed
        UI label: In Review
    end note
    note right of settled
        UI label: Paid Out
    end note
